===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{senseid|en|Q161090}} An aromatic [[perennial]] [[plant]], formerly used as a [[strewing herb]], {{taxfmt|Galium odoratum|species}} (formerly {{taxfmt|Asperula odorata|species}}), with small white flowers.
#: {{syn|en|{{vern|sweetscented bedstraw}}|waldmeister|woodruff|wuderove}}

